# I10 · 数值与写入内容的实测（测试机 Linux，2026-09-22）

## 1 · 要写进虚拟机的 systemd 服务，语法过不过
systemd-analyze verify 退出码=0
[Unit]
Description=Hunter: write /etc/resolv.conf (this image has no systemd-resolved)
Documentation=https://github.com/agentpit-io/HunterLauncher
Before=docker.service containerd.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
ExecStart=/bin/cp --remove-destination /etc/hunter/resolv.conf /etc/resolv.conf

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target

